### New Three Kingdom
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.title=New Three Kingdom
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.description=§c§l(Only in Chinese) §r（量筒巴豆原创）你也要被天意侵蚀吗？又寸。
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.phrase1=§o"平民听令，自！刎！归！天！"
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.phrase2=§o"Nya——！（盖饭）"
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.phrase3=§o"不可能！绝对不可能！"
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.phrase4=§o"公子啊，我能不能不逃了，听天由命吧"
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.phrase5=§o"你挨了人打还好意思说啊，你为何不以死相拼呢"
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.phrase6=§o"不是杀手害了我，是这个乱世害了我啊！"
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.phrase7=§o"我老人家死的好惨啊！呱！yue。"
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.phrase8=§o"今天我%s就把脖子伸在这里，有种你就砍了去！"
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.phrase9=§o"你这把刀要把我的心都刺穿了！"
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.phrase10=§o"罢，罢，罢啊，苍天助杀手不助我！"
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.phrase11=§o"死不可怕，死是凉爽的夏夜，可供人无忧地安眠"
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.phrase12=§o"You fool! You should fast!"
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.phrase13=§o"恨天！！！"
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.phrase14=§o"咱家恨不得把那些狼心狗肺的杀手，都给我揪出来砍咯！砍咯！"
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.phrase15=§o"他是刺客！是贼子！是来行刺咱家的！"
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.phrase16=§o"和杀手玩躲猫猫，我还不如听听我的蛐蛐叫呢"
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.phrase17=§o"这是上天赐予我的葬身之地啊！"
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.phrase18=§o"我不能走啊！杀手，我不能走啊！"
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.phrase19=§o"儿建议，大开城门，放杀手逃生！"
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.phrase20=§o"值啊，就是平民全死了我都值！"
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.phrase21=§o"%s回不来了，我心痛欲裂——！"
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.phrase22=§o"我这辈子，把你当成了最知心的朋友"
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.phrase23=§o"（正在播放：关羽之歌）"
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.phrase24=§o"记住，不要愤怒，愤怒会降低你的技术"
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.phrase25=§o"噔噔噔噔噔噔！"
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.phrase26=§o"封我为五虎上将，你服不服啊，哈哈哈哈哈哈！"
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.phrase27=§o"说出吾名，吓汝一跳！我乃是密室杀手上将军%s！"
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.phrase28=§o"这局我败兵必哀，下一局我就哀兵必胜了！"
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.phrase29=§o"杀手扎聋了我的耳朵！"
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.phrase30=§o"恭喜杀手爷可以称帝了！"
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.phrase31=§o"你们要是还容得下杀手在此肆意放肆，那就容我%s告老还乡了！"
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.phrase32=§o"杀手贼！奸贼！恶贼！逆——贼！"
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.phrase33=§o"天地之间茫苍苍，一时多少豪强"
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.phrase34=§o"哪怕天崩地裂，乾坤毁灭，也必然殉天而死，断断不降"
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.phrase35=§o"胜败要看天意，天意所至，你想不胜都难"
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.phrase36=§o"自尽便是懦夫"
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.phrase37=§o"这刀是朕让杀手掏的"
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.phrase38=§o"啊？真的吗？"
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.phrase39=§o"杀手你扪心自问，你对得起朕吗？"
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.phrase40=§o"我被杀手杀死，这事恐怕要流传百年了啊啊啊啊啊啊啊"
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.phrase41=§o"禽兽，我不是人，禽兽啊！我与禽兽绝不两立！"
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.phrase42=§o"不就是个手腕子吗，折了膀子也得接着打，起来！"
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.phrase43=§o"（正在播放：刘备之死）"
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.phrase44=§o"你们且退，我要睡了"
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.phrase45=§o"在下一者为列位诸公悲伤，二者给列位诸公道喜"
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.phrase46=§o"啊！反了！反了！"
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.phrase47=§o"杀手，你也闻到我府里的酒香了？"
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.phrase48=§o"儿啊，为父是开国以来第一个被斩的大都督"
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.phrase49=§o"我走了，你们吃什么？"
lastWords.newThreeKingdom.phrase50=§o"若是能让杀手爷痛快些，臣妾愿天天给杀手爷砍"

